      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: I mean if I so chose to save a file as a .bmp\n\nthat would be a very unconventional filetype. But the main goal is an option between png and jpg.\n\nAlso I think you are misreading my post. This is not a bug report, it is a feature request. The camera works fine. What would be nice would be a simple config option to be able to change output format on the camera.",
