  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "when you take high enough resolution photos, the filesize starts quickly ballooning due to being PNG. Would be nice if we could choose to output to other filetypes, like JPG. Hell, the more options the better, you could potentially get some interesting photo effects out of unconventional filetypes.\n\nbut at the very least just for the sake of filesize.",
